{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbed4e9f7b22b40faa6abea75206355c56444c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}{m}= b-\\log_{10}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/0/2902298b15f8ccbeae867659d755fa5dc9983048.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=$\" width=\"34\" height=\"8\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/4/904aaaf96f37dcd7b0506c6e4c4c6537248af982.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{b}{n}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ bn\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 10^{b}n\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ b-10^{n}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{10^{b}}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"461\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba75dec963067ab7f508d18ebccdc198f2e97aa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\log_{10}{10^b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" />. Substituting, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/3/273dfb46d8da4d40a50387569b6e147932fb69cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}{m}= \\log_{10}{10^b}-\\log_{10}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"219\" height=\"20\" />. Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/3/c93a8e1b8e7d88bb9ef58c9c38939a98df3c9efd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log{a}-\\log{b}=\\log{\\dfrac{a}{b}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"155\" height=\"33\" />, the left side becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/4/614b8720769e76221afe79ca47c5e66aed921a4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}{\\dfrac{10^b}{n}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"67\" height=\"39\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/4/624403e4f90abb1ca75ca6cb1947a382a3b137a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}{m}=\\log_{10}{\\dfrac{10^b}{n}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"148\" height=\"39\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88d336d84df9e7f9d68ec9b7b8ad5c33642b736c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(E) }\\dfrac{10^b}{n}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"107\" height=\"51\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a56291d875cf083c2497228abc80548aaf9ff70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" /> to both sides:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/d/acd4aae819e142a2d1f955adf4173b699ab685c3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{10} m + \\log_{10} n=b\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"17\" />\nusing the logarithm property: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/2/932b6960ecd62354c3430ecd7805d219be9c5029.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a {b} + \\log_a {c}=\\log_a{bc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"182\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/d/cbded8a2340f38f2e9c93e2c89067f6457b1429b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{10} {mn}=b\\]\" width=\"99\" height=\"17\" />\nrewriting in exponential notation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/1/8b10c86f05dc25ebc5f3cea860f97588d503106d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10^b=mn\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/d/99d0c6f5d34ea6d45d7ce6820dc2985563f111a6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(E) }\\dfrac{10^b}{n}}\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"51\" />\n~Vndom\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>More simply, we can just simulate the problem, if we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/9/5f9c5bf97ea0e3c3046ed67ba3329e47397921dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />, that means the right side must be 1, so the only way we can achieve that with distinct <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, is if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/6/246ec286b9641f91f9dfa14932e47171e2fad854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/6/5c6aa7587b859acde2cd02c0ba835e21ba08aa4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />. With this we can look through the different answer choices substituting in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, and find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d6844d58ce8704f3be6eff14bdac8154da2943f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"38\" height=\"29\" /> is the only one that satisfies the question.\n</p><p>~Shadow-18\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/